                        <h2 class="title">绍兴一中教育集团学生军训安全与管理制度及安全工作应急预案</h2>
                        <!-- 副标题 -->
                        <h3 class="subTitle"><span></span></h3>
                        <script>
                        $(".Subheading span:empty").parent().hide()
                        </script>
                        <div class="property"> <span>文章来源：</span> <span>作者：</span> <span>发布时间：2024年08月23日</span> <span>点击数：
    <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/Common/GetHits.aspx?id=20121"></script>
    次</span>  <span><span id="content_AdminEdit"></span>
<script type="text/javascript">
$(document).ready(function()
{
    $.pe.ajax('admineditcheck',{params:{itemId:20121},success:function(s) {
        if ($(s).find('status').text() == 'OK') {
            var managedir = "/Common/GetContentEdit.aspx?itemId=20121";
           $("#content_AdminEdit").html("【<a href='" + managedir + "' target='_blank'>进入后台编辑</a>】")
        }
    }});
});
</script></span> </div>
                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:21px">绍兴一中</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:21px">教育集团</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:21px">学生军训安全与管理制度</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">根据《中华人民共和国国防法》、《中华人民共和国兵役法》、《中华人民共和国国防教育法》，结合本校实际情况，为了切实做好我校学生军训期间的各项工作，保证正常的训练、工作和生活秩序，防止各类事故的发生，圆满完成军训任务，特制定以下安全工作制度与管理规定。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">一、值班</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">军训教官负责人负责值班，对军训参与人员进行统一管理与指导，安排各班教官每天清点人数、整队集合、督促检查、报告情况等工作。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">二、作息</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">统一执行军训作息时间，全体教官、工作人员、学生必须严格遵守，按时出操、训练、就餐、上课、就寝等。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">三、管理</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">日常管理要严格规范，凡集体活动、训练，均要以班、年级为单位整队带入指定地点。行进过程中做到步伐整齐，有口令声。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">四、训练</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">训练以集中与分散相结合，每次训练前必须清点人数，如实按应到、实到、未到人数的方式向教官报告，教官向教官负责人报告。训练与休息时间由教官负责人统一掌握，严禁各行其是。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">五、纪律</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">全体学生要严格要求自己，尊重教官、服从管理、听从指挥。军训期间未经许可，不准随意出入校门，不准接待来人来访。杜绝酗酒、闹事、起哄、打架斗殴等不文明行为。爱护训练器材和学校设施，不得损坏公物。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">六、仪容仪表。军训期间，男生不准留长发、大鬓角和胡须；女生不准戴耳环、项链，不准描眉、涂口红，留长发女生不能披发，应该扎辫子。各教官要经常督促检查，发现问题及时纠正。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">七、出勤与请销假</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">全体学生要积极参加训练，各班必须每天分上、下午</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">、</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">晚上三</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">次清点学生人数，分别上报随班教官，由各教官上报教官负责人。学生无特殊情况一律不准请假，确因事因病请假的，须本人书面申请，或持医院开具的病假条，由班主任核实并征询教官意见，报学校德育处批准，方可缺课。轻病号可以不参加训练，但须到场，请假学生军训活动学分不得分。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">八、内务卫生</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">严格按照部队的要求，被子叠放整齐，铺面平整，物品放置有序，地面、门窗清洁卫生。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">九、检查与评比</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">军训结尾进行军训会操，按成绩评比</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">各类奖项，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">获奖将计入班级考核或学生个人成长档案。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">十、记录与考评</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">各班要对好人好事、违规违纪的人和事进行登记，并及时报给德育处。军训结束时，德育处根据情况与学生综合素质评价体系，班级军训奖评等挂钩。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">十一、切实加强和做好安全工作</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">  </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">每位军训学生，要高度重视安全防范工作，注意个人饮食卫生，防止疾病的发生。要保管好自己的贵重物品和现金，防止丢失。寝室内严禁私拉乱接电线，违章使用电器，严禁使用明火照明，严禁吸烟，杜绝火灾事故。全体承训教官、教师要把安全工作放在首位，高度重视训练过程中每个环节的安全工作，指导并要求学生严格遵守操作规程。做到经常提醒、督促、检查，并采取有效措施，防止各类事故发生。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">十二、组织安全教育</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">军训前安全教育：通过讲座、班会等形式，对学生进行军训安全知识、纪律要求、自救互救技能等方面的教育。网络舆情教育：加强网络素养教育，引导学生文明上网，不在微博、微信、抖音等网络平台发表不当言论、图片和视频。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">十三、建立学生军训日报和学生军训舆情处置机制</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">学生军训日报：每日收集学生军训情况，包括训练进展、身体状况、安全隐患等，及时上报安全工作领导小组。舆情处置机制：设立专人负责监测网络舆情，一旦发现涉及军训的负面信息，立即启动舆情处置预案，及时澄清事实，消除不良影响。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">以上安全工作制度和管理规定，各班要认真组织参训学生学习，遵照执行，并督促检查、落实。如有违反，按照绍兴一中学生管理相关规定予以严肃处理。</span></p><p style="text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:21px">
</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:21px">
</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:21px">绍兴一中</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:21px">教育集团</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">202</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">4</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:21px">年新生军训安全工作应急预案</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">为确保高一新生军训工作安全顺利进行，特制定本预案。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（一）成立高一新生军训安全工作领导小组：</span><span style="font-family:Calibri"> </span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">组</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">  </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">长：</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">蒋明</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">副组长：俞奇弘、</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">杨佩琼、冯王亮</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">成员：</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">刘明玉、杨大为、孟德超、何隽豪、王佩金、茹奕蓓、钟慧军；高一各班班主任；医务（范国娟、魏杲）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">；</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（二）安全措施：</span><span style="font-family:Calibri"> </span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">202</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">4</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">级高一新生都必须参加军训。军训之前，学校对所有参训学生进行身体状况摸底，填写《学生个体特殊情况调查表》。凡有心血管、肝脏疾病等不适宜参加军训的学生，须向学校军训安全工作领导小组递交有家长签字的免训申请书，由校军训安全工作领导小组审批。凡有其他特殊情况的，在军训过程中作特殊安排。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）各班主任必须亲临军训现场，协助指导和组织学生军训工作，严格把好安全关。</span><span style="font-family:Calibri"> </span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）医疗保健组备好有关应急药品和急救设备设施。</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">4</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）总务处在军训期间准备好足量饮用水，并配送到位。</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">5</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）医务室负责食堂、卖点的卫生检查落实，特别是食品进货渠道的检查监督，食堂餐具的消毒工作落实，食堂人员个人卫生落实。</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">6</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）如遇天气等自然灾害，军训工作领导小组根据实际情况快速作出调整此方案的决定。</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">（</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">三</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">）突发事件分类与应对措施</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1.</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">学生中暑</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">立即将中暑学生移至阴凉通风处，解开衣领，用冷水擦拭身体降温。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">给予淡盐水或含电解质的饮料补充水分。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">症状严重者立即送医治疗，并通知家长。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2.</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">食物中毒</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">迅速隔离疑似中毒人员，保护现场，防止事态扩大。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">立即联系医疗机构进行救治，并告知中毒食物种类。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">保留中毒食物样本，配合卫生部门调查处理。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3.</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">意外伤害（如跌伤、扭伤等）</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">对受伤学生进行初步检查和处理，必要时送医治疗。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">记录事故经过，为后续处理提供依据。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">4.</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">自然灾害（如高温、暴雨等）</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">根据天气预报提前做好准备，调整训练计划。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">遇高温天气，合理安排训练时间和强度，提供防暑降温措施。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">遇暴雨等恶劣天气，立即停止训练，组织学生疏散至安全地带。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">5.</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">教官与学生冲突</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">立即制止冲突，将双方隔离，避免事态升级。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">调查冲突原因，对责任方进行批评教育或相应处理。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">加强教官与学生之间的沟通与理解，预防类似事件再次发生。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">6.</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">网络舆情事件</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">及时发现并关注涉及军训的网络舆情信息。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">迅速核实信息真伪，主动回应社会关切。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">加强正面宣传引导，防止负面舆情扩散。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">（</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">四</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">应急响应流程</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">接报与初步处置：接到突发事件报告后，应急领导小组立即启动预案，进行初步处置。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">信息报告与决策：信息联络组及时收集、整理事件信息，向应急领导小组报告；领导小组根据事态发展作出决策。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">现场处置与救援：各应急工作小组按照职责分工迅速到达现场进行处置和救援。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">后期处理与总结：事件得到控制后，进行后续处理工作（如伤员救治、善后赔偿等），并总结经验教训，完善预案。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent: 400px; line-height: 150%; text-align: right;"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">绍兴一中</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">教育集团</span></p><p style="text-indent: 432px; line-height: 150%; text-align: right;"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">202</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">4-</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">08-2</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p>
</p>
    
